-- ESMEEN SHABAH BA3D ---------------------------------- main.franco.kl  SEC0104

`کتاب` (U+06A9 U+062A U+0627 U+0628) w `كتاب` (U+0643 U+062A U+0627 U+0628) esmeen mokhtalfeen f el scope da bas shabah ba3d ba3d ma el 7oroof el shabah ba3d tetwa7ad (zay `ي` w `ى`, aw `ك` w `ک`, aw 7arf latini w el 7arf el cyrillic elly shabaho). Elly beye2ra mesh hay3raf el satr beyesta5dem anhy esm.

3│     khali کتاب = "b"
             ^^^^

Mosa3da: Ghayar esm wa7ed fehom 3ashan yeb2o mokhtalfeen b shakl bayen, w 3addel el amaken elly beyesta5demo.

E3raf aktar: kalam explain SEC0104
